TEXT 64 1040 Left 2 ;Complete 6-bit segmented current-steering DAC: one Vunregulated (5 V) source and one ground. The regulator output VREF is the VDD of the DAC core and the op-amp; VBN/VCN are shared bias lines; DAC IOUT drives the unity-gain op-amp buffer (VOUT).
